{
 "_what": "Per-zone dressing for tools/map/gen_map.py. One entry per config.Zones Id (design/game.json). Zone ORDER, LENGTH, name and power come from game.json; colours, ground and props come from here. To add a zone: add its row to config.Zones, add an entry here, regenerate. Model names are ReplicatedStorage.Assets.Kit.<Name>; sizes come from the mesh manifests, else design/kit.json. Names starting Prop_store_ are free Creator Store models the owner asked for (tools/studio/install_store_assets.py; sizes in assets/meshes/manifest-store.json).",
 "_lists": {
  "foot": "props at the foot of BOTH walls of every lane, cycled so the same model never repeats twice in a row. Must fit the 9-stud margin (depth <= 8.6 once turned to face the lane).",
  "set": "a set piece every 50-70 studs, alternating walls. Same 9-stud margin rule.",
  "walltop": "props on top of the 12-wide inner walls (trees go here: they are too wide for the margin).",
  "skyline": "landmarks on the 20-wide outer wall tops and the hills behind them, so the zone has a skyline.",
  "hills": "cheap repeated props on the hills behind the outer walls.",
  "generated_kinds": "Our own generated models by ROLE. gen_map.py uses one only when design/store_assets.json has no store piece of that kind for the zone (brief E: store first). A generated model's zone comes from its name (Prop_<zoneId>_ / Prop_shared_ = all).",
  "kind_fallback": "When a zone has no store or generated piece of a kind, the next kind in this list is used; every fallback is printed and written to the spec (layout.pools).",
  "town": "Per zone: 'row' kinds cycled along each building row on the wall terraces, 'landmark' kinds for the tall piece every 150-200 studs, 'spine' kinds for the trees and lanterns between the two rows, 'hills' kinds for the outer tiers. 'gap': one piece placed in a tree gap between clusters (pirate treasure, ninja rope bridge).",
  "floor": "v3 lane floor: floor_texture (landing strip tile), pave (margin paving material), wall_texture (wall panel tile), hung (what hangs between the pilasters, cycled per bay: noren, banner, lanterns, sign, window, poster). Texture names are assets/map/textures/<name>.png."
 },
